'literal\path\': 'C:\literal\'
"escaped\\path\\": "C:\\escaped\\"
"quote\"key": "quote\"value"
"\u{1f600}": "\u{0} \u{e9} \u{1f600}"
'日本語': 'café'

----------------------------------------------------

[
	["key", "'literal\\path\\'"],
	["punctuation", ":"],
	["string", "'C:\\literal\\'"],
	["key", "\"escaped\\\\path\\\\\""],
	["punctuation", ":"],
	["string", "\"C:\\\\escaped\\\\\""],
	["key", "\"quote\\\"key\""],
	["punctuation", ":"],
	["string", "\"quote\\\"value\""],
	["key", "\"\\u{1f600}\""],
	["punctuation", ":"],
	["string", "\"\\u{0} \\u{e9} \\u{1f600}\""],
	["key", "'日本語'"],
	["punctuation", ":"],
	["string", "'café'"]
]

----------------------------------------------------

Literal backslashes stay literal, escaped backslashes and quotes stay inside strings and keys, and Unicode keys and escapes remain intact.
